    {
      "id": "DK4_MES_B47_R0005",
      "english": "{HEX:06}Hayreddin's intent is unclear,{LB}but travel here{LB}is safe now.{PAD}"
    },
    {
      "id": "DK4_MES_B47_R0017",
      "english": "{HEX:04}Yes. Pirate attacks each visit{LB}would cost us{LB}too many lives.{PAD}"
    },
    {
      "id": "DK4_MES_B47_R0044",
      "english": "{HEX:06}Avoid the Ottomans.{LB}Too risky.{LB}{PAD}"
    },
    {
      "id": "DK4_MES_B47_R0049",
      "english": "Why?{PAD}"
    },
    {
      "id": "DK4_MES_B47_R0053",
      "english": "{HEX:06}The eastern sea is Ottoman,{LB}the Pasha navy's domain.{LB}They would target us,{LB}and we could not win.{PAD}"
    },
    {
      "id": "DK4_MES_B47_R0064",
      "english": "Then avoid the Ottoman area{LB}of the Mediterranean{LB}until later.{PAD}"
    },
    {
      "id": "DK4_MES_B47_R0071",
      "english": "Then avoid Valdes and Pasha{LB}areas of the Mediterranean{LB}until we are stronger.{LB}{PAD}"
    },
    {
      "id": "DK4_MES_B47_R0077",
      "english": "{HEX:06}No need to force contracts.{LB}Do not provoke them.{LB}{PAD}"
    },
    {
      "id": "DK4_MES_B47_R0081",
      "english": "{HEX:06}Large cities may have{LB}skilled sailors.{LB}Visit them to find allies.{LB}{PAD}"
    },
    {
      "id": "DK4_MES_B47_R0092",
      "english": "{HEX:04}Wise.{PAD}"
    },
    {
      "id": "DK4_MES_B47_R0102",
      "english": "{HEX:05}Right.{LB}We need stronger ships{LB}and stronger selves.{PAD}"
    },
    {
      "id": "DK4_MES_B47_R0106",
      "english": "{HEX:06}Exactly.{LB}Visit large cities for sailors.{LB}Don't forget.{PAD}"
    },
    {
      "id": "DK4_MES_B47_R0111",
      "english": "So much{LB}to do!{PAD}"
    },
    {
      "id": "DK4_MES_B47_R0122",
      "english": "{HEX:04}Busy now.{PAD}"
    },
    {
      "id": "DK4_MES_B47_R0130",
      "english": "Let's go!{PAD}"
    },
    {
      "id": "DK4_MES_B48_R0296",
      "english": "{HEX:06}Hey!{PAD}"
    },
    {
      "id": "DK4_MES_B48_R0301",
      "english": "Julio!{PAD}"
    },
    {
      "id": "DK4_MES_B48_R0305",
      "english": "{HEX:06}Hm?{LB}You were here?!{PAD}"
    },
    {
      "id": "DK4_MES_B48_R0308",
      "english": "{HEX:4B}Julio!{PAD}"
    },
    {
      "id": "DK4_MES_B48_R0312",
      "english": "{HEX:06}Hans! There you are!{PAD}"
    },
    {
      "id": "DK4_MES_B48_R0321",
      "english": "What?!{LB}You sought him?{PAD}"
    },
    {
      "id": "DK4_MES_B48_R0324",
      "english": "{HEX:06}Yes. He's an old friend.{LB}He studies the Proof.{PAD}"
    },
    {
      "id": "DK4_MES_B48_R0327",
      "english": "{HEX:4B}Oh!{LB}You seek the Proof{LB}as well?{PAD}"
    },
    {
      "id": "DK4_MES_B48_R0332",
      "english": "No...{LB}What is this Proof{LB}of Conquest?{PAD}"
    },
    {
      "id": "DK4_MES_B48_R0336",
      "english": "{HEX:08}A treasure in each sea.{LB}They say{LB}it belongs to one who{LB}rules that sea.{PAD}"
    },
    {
      "id": "DK4_MES_B48_R0339",
      "english": "{HEX:4B}Much remains unknown.{LB}But we may have found{LB}a clue to locate them.{PAD}"
    },
    {
      "id": "DK4_MES_B48_R0343",
      "english": "{HEX:06}You found it?{PAD}"
    },
    {
      "id": "DK4_MES_B48_R0347",
      "english": "{HEX:4B}Old texts say there are seven.{LB}The Seven Sages marked{LB}their sealed locations{LB}on maps of many shapes.{PAD}"
    },
    {
      "id": "DK4_MES_B48_R0350",
      "english": "{HEX:4B}One destined to rule each sea{LB}will someday obtain{LB}its map.{PAD}"
    },
    {
      "id": "DK4_MES_B48_R0355",
      "english": "Then we can{LB}gather them!{PAD}"
    }
  ]
}
